    },
    {
      "block_id": "2009.00031_p5_b2",
      "text": "LX = 5.4 \u00d7 1034 erg s\u22121 (d/ 5 kpc)2. For PSR J1813\u22121749,\n\u0393 = 1.2 \u00b1 0.1 and f abs\n",
