    {
      "block_id": "2009.00031_p5_b3",
      "text": "2\u221210 \u22481.5 \u00d7 10\u221212 erg cm\u22122 s\u22121, which\nresults in fX = 3.1 \u00d7 10\u221212 erg cm\u22122 s\u22121 and LX = 9.3 \u00d7\n1033 erg s\u22121 (d/ 5 kpc)2. The X-ray luminosity relative to\nspin-down power of PSR J1813\u22121749 is LX/ \u00dbE = 1.7 \u00d7 10\u22124\n",
