    {
      "block_id": "2009.00031_p5_b6",
      "text": "We brie\ufb02y compare our spectral \ufb01tting results to those\nof previous works. Helfand et al. (2007) \ufb01t the PWN spec-\ntra (ObsID 6685) with absorption NH = 9.8+1.2\n",
