    {
      "block_id": "2009.00031_p5_b9",
      "text": "2\u221210 = 5.6 \u00d7 10\u221212 erg cm\u22122 s\u22121. Spectra of the inner neb-\nula and pulsar are each \ufb01t with a PL and \ufb01xing NH to\nthat of the PWN. The inner nebula spectral \ufb01t yields\n\u0393 = 0.4+0.4\n",
