    {
      "block_id": "2009.00031_p5_b12",
      "text": "2\u221210 =\n1.3 \u00d7 10\u221212 erg cm\u22122 s\u22121. Kuiper & Hermsen (2015) anal-\nyse a 98 ks XMM-Newton EPIC-pn spectrum taken on 2009\nMarch 27 (ObsID 0552790101) and, with an extraction ra-\ndius of 15\u2032\u2032 which includes some contribution from the PWN,\n\ufb01nd a consistent photon index \u0393 = 1.31 \u00b1 0.01 and \ufb02ux\n",
      "bbox": [
