    {
      "block_id": "2009.00031_p5_b18",
      "text": "We process and \ufb01lter NICER data of PSR J1813\u22121749\n(see Table 1) using HEASoft 6.26.1, NICERDAS 2019-06-\n19 V006a, and the psrpipe.py script from the NICERsoft\npackage2. We exclude all events from \u201chot\u201d detector 34,\nwhich gives elevated count rates in some circumstances, and\nportions of exposure accumulated during passages through\nthe South Atlantic Anomaly. NICER experienced a time\nstamp anomaly which resulted in incorrect time stamps for\n",
